- **Spend:** nick approved the run in session (2026-11-04, "go with the third, amend the gate and run it");
  the manifest carries about $20, hard stop $25. The pre-registration landed on main before the arm
  change (#3831, both in the same PR, pushed as a draft first per ADR 223).
- **Deploy** from main `7c024748` (#3832 was the head; #3831 the arm): `MUSTERD_REF=7c024748…`, musterd
  0.7.0 on the host, Claude Code 2.1.307 on the host and in every agent container. Deployed from the
  Hetzner joiner with a 48 h deploy token nick minted (fifty's runbook carries it for revocation).
  After the deploy: `useradd smoke`, the swe_agent `trajectories` directory did not exist on the
